      "writtenOn": "2022-04-06T20:55:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`ZTEST_SUITE` runs `before`, `rules`, and `test` in this order.  One of the `rules` resets the tcpi emulator registers to all zero.  This affects the RX_DETECT_SOP bit that was setup in `before` and we\u0027re unable to successfully send control messages in this state.",
